      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَتَاوِتُ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَسَاوِسُ</span> <i>Evil suggestions, &amp;c.</i> (K.)
The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">س</span> is thus changed, in poetry, into <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ت</span>, as
in <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاتٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْيَاتٌ</span>. (MF.)

